// keydown handlers listen in the capture phase, so the highlight + dim
// actually engages and Escape / empty-space clicks clear it (see the listener
// comment below); a wiped focus is re-applied by the watchdog interval.
// Build 2026-10-17_1446: arcR (the center keep-out radius arcs route
// around) rises 450→1350 to match the ~4x enlarged center node, so routed
// arcs still clear the outer at-a-glance ring.
