    // non-emptiness condition is the bundle's own: __sxOnDeckTotal —
    // tier1 + tier2 + direction + tier3 + unreviewed membership from
    // __sxOnDeckMembers — greater than zero, taken for the bundle's
    // current profile: the selected profile tab's data-view id, or the
    // bundle's empty-profile preview sentinel when no profile is
